# ---- 构建产物 ----
# C++ 是唯一在维护的实现，产物路径写死；
# 三个冻结版统一挪进了 legacy/，路径跟着改。
cpp/build/
cpp/out/
legacy/python/build/
legacy/python/dist/
legacy/python/*.spec
legacy/csharp/build/
legacy/csharp/obj/
legacy/csharp/bin/
legacy/csharp/*.user
legacy/rust/target/
*.exe
*.obj
*.o
*.res
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.lib

# ---- 运行期生成 ----
config.json
config.bad.json
run-status.json
*.log
!LICENSE

# 自测用的全屏截图会带上真实桌面，不进版本库
docs/shots/*-verify.png

# ---- 编辑器 / 系统 ----
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
